{
  "_id": "h1VBWeh2GTO9UAE4",
  "name": "Tempest Herald",
  "type": "effect",
  "img": "modules/titan-vttrpg-compendium/icons/paths/Stormcaller_Path_Icon.webp",
  "description": "<p>You have transformed into a dragon made of Malefic lightning.</p><ul><li><p>Your <strong>Body</strong> and <strong>Soul</strong> increase by <strong>+2</strong>.</p></li><li><p>You gain a <strong>Fly</strong> speed of <strong>5</strong>. If you already have a <strong>Fly</strong> Speed, it increases by <strong>+5</strong>.</p></li><li><p>You are immune to all conditions except <strong>Dying</strong>.</p></li><li><p>If you start <strong>Dying</strong>, you are not stunned.</p></li><li><p>Once per turn, when you inflict <strong>Damage</strong> to a creature afflicted with a condition, suffering from Stormcaller ability, or affected by a <strong>Hazard</strong>, you may choose inflict additional Damage equal to your Soul.</p></li></ul><p><span style=\"font-family: 'Open Sans',sans-serif\"><strong style=\"font-weight:normal;\" id=\"docs-internal-guid-dcd12564-7fff-bcb5-c45b-7173bd86e5d6\">This effect lasts until the end of combat, you become </strong><strong>Incapacitated</strong>, or you are <strong>Dying</strong>. After you use this ability, you cannot use any ability with the <strong>Apex</strong> trait until you complete a <strong>Long Rest</strong>.</span></p><p>Additionally, Stormcallers and followers of the <strong>Weeping Dragon</strong> will recognize your skill and afford you special respect.</p>",
